Disable Parameter Name Hints in VSCodium (C++)

Steps via GUI:

    Press Ctrl + , to open Settings.

    Search for: inlay hints

Find:

    C_Cpp › Inlay Hints: Parameter Names: Enabled

    Uncheck it/off
